	-- ["Keep handing in {quest:7812} until {faction:54} is Exalted. {item:14047}: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in {zone:1423}, or the Auction House."] = "继续交还{quest:7812}，直到{faction:54}达到崇拜。{item:14047}：{zone:1423}的黑暗教徒和暗影法师（58-60级），或拍卖行。",
	-- ["Keep handing in {quest:7812}, 20 {item:14047} at a time. {item:14047}: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in {zone:1423}, or the Auction House."] = "继续交还{quest:7812}，每次20块{item:14047}。{item:14047}：{zone:1423}的黑暗教徒和暗影法师（58-60级），或拍卖行。",
	-- ["Optional: eastern {zone:1426}, from {npc:264936}'s camp to the {area:134} and {area:803}, about 500 reputation (100 at a fifth) in 30 minutes at 60. In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可选：{zone:1426} 东部，从 {npc:264936} 的营地到 {area:134} 和 {area:803}，60级时约30分钟获得500点声望（若只有五分之一则为100点）。经典版中，低于你6级或更多的任务奖励会减少（60级时为五分之一）；一份无限服测试报告称会给全额声望。首次交还即可判断：如果只有五分之一，就跳过这些任务点。跳过此步骤即可跳过该任务点。",
	-- ["Optional: the Dwarf and Gnome start valley south-west of {area:131}, about 1,150 reputation (230 at a fifth) in 30 minutes at 60. {npc:658} and {npc:713} stand at {area:77}. In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可选：矮人和侏儒的起始山谷位于 {area:131} 西南，60 级时约 30 分钟可得 1,150 点声望（按五分之一计算则为 230 点）。{npc:658} 和 {npc:713} 站在 {area:77}。经典怀旧服中，比你低 6 级及以上的任务会减少奖励（60 级时只有五分之一）；一份无限测试服报告称仍有全额奖励。第一次交还就能看出实际情况：如果只有五分之一，就跳过这些任务点。跳过本步骤即可略过此任务点。",
	-- ["Optional: {area:131} and the Brewnall and {area:133} roads around it, about 1,300 reputation (260 at a fifth) in 50 minutes at 60. Most givers stand in and around the {area:2102} and at {area:189} east of it. In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可选：{area:131} 及周围通往涌冰湖和 {area:133} 的道路，60 级时花约 50 分钟可获得约 1,300 点声望（按五分之一计算为 260 点）。大多数任务给予者在 {area:2102} 内外及其东侧的 {area:189}。在经典旧世中，比你低至少 6 级的任务声望奖励会减少（60 级时降至五分之一）；一份无限测试版报告称，任务仍提供全额声望。第一次交还任务时就能看出：如果只给五分之一，就跳过这些任务点。跳过本步骤即可跳过这个任务点。",
	-- ["Riverpaw Bandits and Taskmasters (level 16-18) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "这里的河爪强盗和河爪监工（16-18级）会掉落。也可以去拍卖行购买。",
	-- ["Syndicate Mercenaries at Stromgarde (level 31-32) drop it here. The Auction House works too."] = "激流堡的辛迪加雇佣兵（31-32级）会掉落。也可以去拍卖行购买。",
	-- ["{npc:14724} takes cloth for {faction:54} in {object:171524}, {zone:1455}. The first donations of Wool, Silk, Mageweave and {item:14047} (60 cloth each) are done once and give the most reputation per cloth; after them, {quest:7812} repeats until Exalted. Exalted with another race's city lets you buy that race's mounts. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk increases reputation gains."] = "{npc:14724}在{zone:1455}的{object:171524}收取布料以提升{faction:54}声望。首次捐献毛料、丝绸、魔纹布和{item:14047}（各60块）只能做一次，每块布给的声望最多；之后{quest:7812}可重复做到崇拜。与其他种族的主城达到崇拜后，可购买该种族的坐骑。Forever的传承外交官特权可提高声望获取。",
	-- ["{npc:14724}: {item:14047} delivered"] = "{npc:14724}：已交付{item:14047}",
	-- ["{quest:7812} takes 20 {item:14047} per turn-in and repeats as often as you like. Bring {item:14047} in multiples of 20 and hand them all in at once, one turn-in after another. {item:14047}: Dark Adepts and Shadowmages (level 58-60) in {zone:1423}, or the Auction House."] = "{quest:7812}每次交还需要20块{item:14047}，可无限重复。按20的倍数带上{item:14047}，一次接一次全部交还。{item:14047}：{zone:1423}的黑暗教徒和暗影法师（58-60级），或拍卖行。",
	-- ["{quest:7812}: 50 reputation for 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. After the four first donations a Human, Dwarf or Night Elf stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 {item:14047} (Gnomes start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; Skyborne start at Neutral 2,000, so 6,400 away: 128, two fewer after Exploring the Alliance). {npc:9616}'s and {npc:9561}'s quests above take 8 turn-ins off; each {zone:1426} hub you did takes 10 to 26 more off if it paid in full. Outside Dun Morogh Gnomeregan pays little: {npc:4077}'s quests in Stonetalon (about 500) and {object:171524}'s {area:133} dungeon quests. Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your {item:14047} at once."] = "{quest:7812}：每20个{item:14047}奖励50声望，可无限重复。完成前4次首次捐赠后，人类、矮人或暗夜精灵的进度为友善700/6,000，距尊敬还差5,300：需交还106次，共2,120个{item:14047}（侏儒起始高900：需88次；天裔起始为中立2,000，因此还差6,400：需128次，完成“探索联盟”后可少2次）。上面{npc:9616}和{npc:9561}的任务可减少8次交还；做过的每个{zone:1426}任务区，若奖励全额声望，还可再减少10至26次。丹莫罗以外能获得的诺莫瑞根声望很少：{npc:4077}在石爪山脉的任务（约500），以及{object:171524}的{area:133}地下城任务。每次获得主城声望时，其他3座联盟主城也会获得四分之一的声望（此处未计入）。将所有{item:14047}一次交完。",
}
